{"id":"ley","lemma":"ley","pos":"noun","rank":588,"glosses":["law (a well-established characteristic of nature)","law (body of rules issued by a legislative body)","law (particular piece of legislation)"],"ipa":"/ˈlei/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"leyes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/45/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-ley.wav","examples":[{"text":"La ley es clara.","en":"The law is clear.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443502"},{"text":"Las leyes son necesarias.","en":"Laws are necessary.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448565"},{"text":"Es una ley estúpida.","en":"It's a stupid law.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443503"},{"text":"Las leyes han cambiado.","en":"The laws have changed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460937"},{"text":"La ley fue modificada.","en":"The law was changed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450232"}]}